  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "企業資源規劃-生產製造模組",
    "sub_ename": "ENTERPRISE RESOURCE PLANNING-MANUFACTORING MODULE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程的目的在整合ERP系統的理論、操作與企業應用，並輔以ERP系統之發展、演進、效益、採購評估、導入模式及維護等議題引導學生對ERP系統全面性的理解與應用。以ERP系統-生管模組為課程主軸，透過案例與上機實務操作，培養學生對於企業生產作業流程、資料庫、與相關系統間之關聯性的理解與實務上的操作與運用。",
    "describe_eh": "ERP is the foundation of enterprises’ operation and management. This course is based on enterprise distribution practice and ERP system demonstration and assisted by ERP evolution and development, its benefits, assessment during procurement, implementation model, maintenance and etc.",
